  <ifrs:DescriptionOfChangesInPlanToSellNoncurrentAssetOrDisposalGroupHeldForSale contextRef="p4">No aplica</ifrs:DescriptionOfChangesInPlanToSellNoncurrentAssetOrDisposalGroupHeldForSale>
